  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improving area coverage of enforcement interventions within the Great Fish River Nature Reserve</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In response to a recent upsurge in poaching, this grant will improve infrastructure to enhance anti-poaching and enforcement activities to better protect southern black rhinos in the Great Fish River Nature Reserve in the Eastern Cape Province, South Africa. Specific activities will include repairing existing buildings and constructing new ranger posts at additional locations within the reserve in order to deploy security staff in areas that have previously been difficult to access and patrol effectively.</narrative>
  </description>
